title: Remove unused dependencies identified by cargo-udeps

doc:
  - audience: [Node Dev, Runtime Dev]
    description: |
      Removes four unused dependencies confirmed by `cargo +nightly udeps`:

      - `bitvec` from `pallet-broker` — not referenced anywhere in source.
      - `rlp` from `snowbridge-beacon-primitives` — leftover from older Ethereum
        light-client code; no usage found in source.
      - `serde_json` from `sp-genesis-builder` — not referenced anywhere in source.
      - `static_assertions` from `sp-runtime-interface` — the crate was never
        called; the `disable_target_static_assertions` feature flag it appeared
        alongside is unrelated and has been preserved.

      Part of #6906.

crates:
  - name: pallet-broker
    bump: patch
  - name: snowbridge-beacon-primitives
    bump: patch
  - name: sp-genesis-builder
    bump: patch
  - name: sp-runtime-interface
    bump: patch
